      "body": "Not the reporter, so I can't test it live. Read the diff though \u2014 `extractBaseUrlFromHeaders` still builds issuer/endpoints/redirect from `x-forwarded-*` / `host`. Fine when the proxy forwards those correctly, wrong issuer the moment it doesn't (tunnel in front of nginx, direct hit on :7575), and Host is client-controlled. Why not `BASE_URL` first, headers only if it's unset?",
      "author_association": "NONE",
