      "body": "Thanks @sameerkhansf \u2014 I updated #6631 so the configured `BASE_URL` is now preferred for MCP OAuth metadata and redirects. Forwarded headers are only used as a fallback when `BASE_URL` is unset. I also added validation and tests for the public origin.",
